WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,270
You divide the rest according to the proportion calculated by me.

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,270
Is there any problem?

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,840
No problem

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,840
I will give you two hundred tons alone

5
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,580
Two hundred tons of grain

6
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:19,580
Give away the remaining base for free

7
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:26,210
With a face

8
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,230
Captain

9
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:30,230
Also a woman

10
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,230
You are so different from others

11
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,230
Let your sister dress up nicely

12
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,230
Maybe some big shot can be put in there too
